        "sid": "1KI 9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "9",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chelili Solomoni namanishi dehi kutuŋa itala daYehova, niitaladamwanta, niyatiyiliyi Solomoni kuwaha yejima, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova hakudimwekeshakudi Solomoni kamuchiyedi, neyi chamwekeniyi kudi yena kuGibeyoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehova hakumwila nindi, Natiyi nimuwunalombi nimuwunalembelelikumesu ami. Itala diwunatuŋili kusha ijina dami hayanyaka nadijiliki. Nimesu ami, nimuchima wami wakekalaku mafuku ejima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakwila eyi, neyi eyi wukwendaŋi kumesu ami neyi mwendeliyi tata yeyi Davidi, namuchima wawuwahi, nakwoloka, nakwila munakulejeli mwejima; neyi wukuhembaŋi yidika yami nawuŋi wami, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ami nakakolesha itandadawanta weyi wawaIsarela haya nyaka; mwomunamukanini tata yeyi Davidi, nami, Hiwakabula iyala hetanda dawaIsarela dawantaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwinzaneyi mwakabalumuka nakuleka kunlonda, hela enu hela anyanenu, neyimwakabula kuhemba munalejaŋa niyidika yami yinayishili kumesu enu, himwakaya nakupesha akishi nakudifukula kudi wena, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ami nakayifumisha aIsarela mwituŋa dinayinkeli; niitalidi dinajilikili ijina dami nakadinatila kwakulehi nanami; aIsarela akashala neyi kaanu, akekala akwakufwŋewa mukachi kanyuza yejima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hela kuleha kunalehi idi itala dinalehi tuhu, antu ejima akahitaku akahayama, akayiŋila, akahosha nawu, Yehova nakoŋelidi ituŋidi niitalidi chochichi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akaakula nawu, Chinafumi hakuleka Yehova Nzambi yawu wafumishili ankakulula jawu mwituŋa daEjipitu, hiyakukwata akishi, hiyakudifukula kudi wena nakuyipesha; dihu hanafumi kuyiletela kutama kwejimiku kudi Yehova.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chiyamanini nyaka makumi ayedi yatuŋiliyi Solomoni matala ayedi, niitala daYehova, niitala damwanta, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mwenomu Hirami mwanta wakuTira wamwinkelaŋa Solomoni nyisida, nanyinjunŋa, nawuru, mwonsu mwakeŋeliyi, mwanta Solomoni hakumwinka Hirami nyikala yamaneni yamu Ŋaliliya makumi ayedi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hirami hakufuma kuTira, hakwinza nakutalanyikala yanamwinkiyi Solomoni; hayitiyili kwindi kuwahaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Welilinindi, Yeniyi nyikala yiwunanyinki hinyikalanyi, mana kwami? Hakuyitumbanindi, Ituŋi daKabuli, nilelu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hirami wamutemesheleli mwantantalenta jawuru nkulakaji namakumi ayedi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tiyenu hafumini chipalu chakwatiliyi mwanta Solomoni. Walondeli kutuŋa itala daYehova, niitala dindi yomweni, niMilo, nimpwembu yaYerusalema, niHazori, niMeGido, niGezeri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Henohu Fwaro mwantawa kuEjipitu wayaku dehi, walukuka dehi Gezeri, wawocha dehi nakesi, wajahamu dehi aKenani ashakamini mumukala, wawinka dehi mwanindiwa mumbanda iŋoda Solomoni chamukunkulu chindi chakusumbuka nachu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Solomoni hakutuŋi Gezeri, ni Betihoroni wamunkulu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "niBayalati, niTamari mwisaŋa, mwituŋa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ninyikala yejima yadiŋiyi nayu Solomoni yakuswekela yuma, ninyikala yakusha makálu indi, ninyikala yakusha antu indi akwatuwalu, niyatiyiliyi Solomoni kuwaha kudituŋala muYerusalema, nikuLebanoni, nimwituŋa damu wanta windi dejima. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amori, niaHiti, ni aPerizi, niaHivi, niaYebusi, antu awu ejima asheluhu, abulili kwikala anyana kaIsarela, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "anyana kanawa ahitili nakushalashala mwituŋa, akaŋenyi kujilumunawu kudi anyana kaIsarela chikupu, diwu akwatiliyi Solomoni chipalu chawuduŋu, nilelu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakwila anyana kaIsarela Solomoni hayikwatili wuduŋuku; wena kwawu diwu akwanjita, niawambuŋindi, niatulamba twindi, niakulumpi indi akunjita, niakulumpi amakálu indi, niantu indi akwatuwalu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Diwu awakulumpi awatulala atalilaŋa nyidimu yaSolomoni, makulakaji atanu namakumi atanu, ayulilaŋa antu akoŋelaŋa nyidimu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwana kaFwaro wakandukili mumukala waDavidi, hakwijila mwitala dindi damutuŋililuwu. Henohu dihu hatuŋiliyi Milo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Solomoni washitilaŋa nyilambu yakushita walambwilaŋa, ninyilambuya kuwunda mwaka wumu kasatu hakameŋa katuŋililiyi Yehova, hakwochela kumu niinsensi, hohakameŋa kadiŋi kumesu aYehova. Hakumanishani itala.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Solomoni watuŋili chendu chamaatu amaneni kuEziyoni Geberiwekala kwakwihi naEloti, kuchi kumu chaKaluŋalwiji Kachinana, mwituŋa daEdomi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hirami watemesheli mumaatu ambuŋindi akwakwendela mumaatu eluka dehi maana ahakaluŋilwŋi, hiyakuya hamu nawambuŋa-Solomoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.9.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.9.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 9:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
